    "resolution_sop": "1. Verify caller identity. Ask for caller name and registered company name. Confirm the registered mobile number.\n2. Confirm GST ownership. Ask if GST is in the business name or another person's name.\n3. Advise eligibility based on GST. If GST is not in your business name, recommend free listing only. If GST is in the same business name, explain paid service eligibility.\n4. Ask for missing business details. Collect full address and a nearby landmark.\n5. Login and navigation. Open the IndiaMART app. Tap the three horizontal lines on the top-left.\n6. Go to Seller Store. Click Seller Store > Manage Product.\n7. Update address and service locations. Edit business address and add landmark so buyers can find you.\n8. Add or edit services. For each service add a clear photo, title, price, short description, and service location. Remove unrelated products (for example, air cooler) if present.\n9. Verify category and nature of business. Ensure service category matches the GST nature of business if you plan to upgrade.\n10. Set up PNS numbers. Link up to five alternate contact numbers to the PNS so incoming calls ring on all linked numbers.\n11. Confirm listing goes live. Save changes and verify the listing appears correctly in search results.\n12. Upsell/Value Add: If GST is in the same business name, offer annual paid services for BuyLeads, priority placement, and an assigned account manager to handle queries and improve lead conversion.",
